{
  "_comment": "Fixed, read-only web event samples for the frontend. Shape matches crates/neo-webui/src/protocol.rs (B1 wire): every long-connection message is a tagged WebUiServerMessage (session_snapshot / workspace_snapshot / session_summary_changed / session_event / session_state / session_metadata_changed); the event payload is the canonical AgentEvent (externally tagged, e.g. {\"TextDelta\":{...}}) with structured ToolOutputRef stripped — full tool and terminal output travels only as the opaque envelope/history-level `output` ({id, byte_len, line_count, complete}) and is read via GET tool-output/<id>. Two sessions, user MessageAppended as the only user-bubble source (including one with image attachments as MediaRef.Blob content parts), full tool lifecycle, Delegate and DelegateSwarm series (including the DelegateProgressUpdated/DelegateSwarmProgressUpdated progress payloads), TokenUsage/ContextWindowUpdated samples plus their cached session_state projections (token_usage/context_window), snapshot watermark + resume, snapshot replacement under a different stream_id, thinking, queued tools, approval/question, retry retraction, task updates, workflow change statistics, the two-tier (workspace summary + full session) subscription wire with the grouped cross-workspace workspace_snapshot (workspaces: [{label, current, sessions}]), slow-consumer close, and stale-control rejection. Path metadata is workspace-relative or `.`; absolute paths never appear; sessions carry only their workspace_label.",
